WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:01.090
Hey, YouTube!

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:03.999
Have you ever wondered why we
only upload one video each month?

00:00:04.489 --> 00:00:06.671
Well, the answer is really easy:
time and money.

00:00:07.131 --> 00:00:09.393
It’s fun, of course, but to make
animation videos like this

00:00:09.393 --> 00:00:11.595
a ridiculous amount of
time is necessary:

00:00:11.595 --> 00:00:15.338
writing the script, storyboard, designing
all the stuff, recording the narration,

00:00:15.338 --> 00:00:18.688
animation, sound design, and
composing original music.

00:00:19.032 --> 00:00:20.734
We would love to make more videos,

00:00:20.734 --> 00:00:23.666
but it’s just impossible right now
without a time machine.

00:00:23.996 --> 00:00:27.285
We all have real jobs and do Kurzgesagt
late nights and on the weekends,

00:00:27.285 --> 00:00:28.374
because it’s our passion.

00:00:28.664 --> 00:00:32.635
But we prefer doing it while the sun is
shining and make more videos for you guys.

00:00:33.093 --> 00:00:37.033
But now you can help us make
more science and educational content.

00:00:37.205 --> 00:00:39.209
There’s this great new thing
called Patreon.

00:00:39.569 --> 00:00:41.874
Patreon is a crowdfunding
platform like Kickstarter,

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:44.179
but it works on a montly basis
with smaller amounts.

00:00:44.619 --> 00:00:46.715
If you want, you can support us
with a smal sum each month

00:00:46.715 --> 00:00:49.811
and we will spend less time working
elsewhere and make more videos.

00:00:50.221 --> 00:00:51.950
Depending on the amount,
you’ll get cool rewards

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:53.929
like graphics for your
smartphone or computer

00:00:53.929 --> 00:00:55.796
and music (links in the
video description),

00:00:55.796 --> 00:00:58.013
or I’ll record your voicemail message.

00:00:58.343 --> 00:01:02.472
“This is the mailbox of a man called
Jimmy.” Something like that.

00:01:02.802 --> 00:01:05.304
Even the smallest amounts help
and we really appreciate it.

00:01:05.554 --> 00:01:07.716
Our videos will stay free
on YouTube forever,

00:01:07.716 --> 00:01:10.278
so if you don’t want to fund us,
nothing will change for you.

00:01:10.768 --> 00:01:13.959
If we get enough money through Patreon,
we can invest more time in Kurzgesagt

00:01:13.959 --> 00:01:16.445
and make more than one video
every four weeks in the future.

00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:20.117
Thank you for your attention,
lots of love, all the feels, Kurzgesagt.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.000
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

